{{ 'nt.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<section class='nt nt-phero'>
  <div class='nt-wrap'>
    <span class='nt-kicker'>關於我們</span>
    <p class='nt-disp nt-disp--md' aria-hidden='true'><span>An angler</span><span><em>in Japan</em></span></p>
    <h1 class='nt-h1'>一個在日本的釣友，幫你把好東西帶回台灣。</h1>
  </div>
</section>
<section class='nt nt-sec'>
  <div class='nt-wrap nt-about'>
    <div>
      <h2 class='nt-h2' style='margin-top:0'>從日本釣具店的貨架，到你的釣箱。</h2>
      <div class='nt-about__patches'>
        {% render 'nt-patch', kind: 'fuji', uid: 'ab1', text: 'NATSUMEYA ★ JAPAN TACKLE ★ ', label: 'Natsumeya 徽章', rot: -6, size: 120 %}
        {% render 'nt-patch', kind: 'fish', uid: 'ab2', text: 'FISH JAPAN ★ NATSUMEYA ★ ', label: 'Natsumeya 徽章', rot: 7, size: 120 %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='nt-about__body'>
      <p>{{ shop.name }} 以日本橫濱為據點。店主本身熱愛釣魚，常跑三浦半島、房總一帶的釣場，也熟悉日本的釣具店與通路。</p>
      <p>很多台灣釣友想買日本限定色、日規型號，卻卡在語言、付款和寄送。所以我們不賣固定商品，而是聽你想要什麼，再到日本現場幫你找、幫你確認、幫你寄。</p>
      <p>來日本旅行想釣魚的朋友，也可以找我們安排釣魚地陪，用中文帶你體驗日本的釣場。</p>
      <ul class='nt-checks'>
        <li><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5'/></svg>人在日本，現場找貨、看得到實品</li>
        <li><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5'/></svg>先報價、付清後才下單，費用逐項列清楚</li>
        <li><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5'/></svg>EMS 寄送，全程追蹤</li>
        <li><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5'/></svg>每一則訊息都由店主親自回覆</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

